Kernel_isModuleInstalled
├── given moduleTypeId is 1 Validator
│   ├── given the validator is installed
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── given the validator is not installed
│       └── it should return false
├── given moduleTypeId is 2 Executor
│   ├── given the executor is installed
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── given the executor is not installed
│       └── it should return false
├── given moduleTypeId is 3 Fallback
│   ├── given the selector is registered to the module
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── given the selector is not registered to the module
│       └── it should return false
├── given moduleTypeId is 4 Hook
│   ├── given the hook is enabled
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── given the hook is not enabled
│       └── it should return false
├── given moduleTypeId is 5 Policy
│   ├── given the permissionId has this policy installed
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── given the permissionId does not have this policy
│       └── it should return false
├── given moduleTypeId is 6 Signer
│   ├── given the permissionId has this signer installed
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── given the permissionId does not have this signer
│       └── it should return false
└── given moduleTypeId is unsupported
    └── it should revert with NotImplemented error
